{"bankId":"B-SRC-42-2884","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"coordinate_scale_distance","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Rajah grid menunjukkan titik A di (2,4) bergerak 6 unit ke kanan. Jika 1 unit mewakili 250 m, berapakah jarak sebenar pergerakan itu?","options":["1.5 km","1.25 km","1.75 km","2.0 km"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jarak pada grid = 6 unit.","6 × 250 m = 1500 m = 1.5 km."],"visual":{"kind":"coordinate_move","start":[2,4],"move_right":6}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2941","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"division_after_rejects","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah pusat sumber menerima 278 buku nota. Sebanyak 14 rosak dan diasingkan. Baki buku nota dibungkus 24 buah setiap kotak. Berapakah kotak penuh yang dapat dihasilkan?","options":["10 kotak","11 kotak","12 kotak","13 kotak"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Baki yang baik = 278 − 14 = 264.","264 ÷ 24 = 11 kotak penuh."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2942","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0003","constructFamily":"fraction_subtract_then_add","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan sebuah tangki berisi 7/8 daripada kapasiti penuh. Kemudian 1/4 daripada kapasiti penuh digunakan dan 1/8 kapasiti penuh ditambah semula. Apakah pecahan kapasiti yang berisi air akhirnya?","options":["1/2","5/8","3/4","7/8"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["1/4 = 2/8, jadi selepas digunakan: 7/8 − 2/8 = 5/8.","Tambah 1/8: 5/8 + 1/8 = 6/8 = 3/4."],"visual":{"kind":"fraction_bar","parts":8,"selected":7}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2944","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"reverse_percentage_attendance","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Pada suatu hari, 20% murid sebuah sekolah tidak hadir. Jika 144 murid hadir, berapakah jumlah murid sekolah itu?","options":["160","172","192","180"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Murid hadir mewakili 100% − 20% = 80%.","144 ÷ 0.8 = 180 murid."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2945","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"ratio_after_addition","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Nisbah guli merah kepada guli biru ialah 3:5 dan jumlah semuanya 64 biji. Selepas 8 guli merah ditambah, apakah nisbah baharu merah kepada biru?","options":["4:5","3:4","4:7","5:6"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["8 bahagian = 64, jadi 1 bahagian = 8. Merah = 24 dan biru = 40.","Selepas tambah 8 merah: 32:40 = 4:5."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2946","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0006","constructFamily":"mean_after_remove_max","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan lima skor 18, 22, 25, 27 dan 28. Jika skor tertinggi dikeluarkan, berapakah min empat skor yang tinggal?","options":["22","23","24","25"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah empat skor yang tinggal = 18 + 22 + 25 + 27 = 92.","Min = 92 ÷ 4 = 23."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[18,22,25,27,28]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2947","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0007","constructFamily":"perimeter_from_area_length","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan segi empat tepat dengan panjang 18 cm dan luas 180 cm². Berapakah perimeter segi empat tepat itu?","options":["46 cm","52 cm","56 cm","60 cm"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Lebar = 180 ÷ 18 = 10 cm.","Perimeter = 2(18 + 10) = 56 cm."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":18,"width_cm":10}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2948","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"area_after_percent_dimension_growth","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah poster berukuran 12 cm × 8 cm. Kedua-dua panjang dan lebarnya dibesarkan sebanyak 25%. Berapakah luas poster baharu?","options":["120 cm²","144 cm²","160 cm²","150 cm²"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Panjang baharu = 12 × 1.25 = 15 cm dan lebar baharu = 8 × 1.25 = 10 cm.","Luas baharu = 15 × 10 = 150 cm²."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2949","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"cuboid_fraction_filled_litre","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan sebuah kuboid 20 cm × 15 cm × 12 cm yang diisi air sebanyak 3/4 daripada isi padunya. Berapakah isi padu air dalam liter?","options":["2.7 L","2.4 L","3.0 L","3.6 L"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Isi padu kuboid = 20 × 15 × 12 = 3600 cm³.","3/4 × 3600 = 2700 cm³ = 2.7 L."],"visual":{"kind":"cuboid","length_cm":20,"width_cm":15,"height_cm":12}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2950","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"multi_stage_schedule_finish","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Satu program bermula pada 10:35 pagi. Sesi pertama berlangsung 1 jam 25 minit, diikuti rehat 20 minit dan sesi kedua 55 minit. Bilakah program tamat?","options":["12:55 tengah hari","1:15 petang","1:05 petang","1:25 petang"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["10:35 pagi + 1 jam 25 minit = 12:00 tengah hari; tambah rehat 20 minit menjadi 12:20.","12:20 + 55 minit = 1:15 petang."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2951","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"money_voucher_and_change","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Aina membeli 3 helai baju pada RM28 setiap satu dan 2 topi pada RM17 setiap satu. Dia menggunakan baucar RM15 dan membayar RM120. Berapakah baki wangnya?","options":["RM12","RM15","RM17","RM22"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah harga = 3 × RM28 + 2 × RM17 = RM118; selepas baucar = RM103.","Baki = RM120 − RM103 = RM17."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2952","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"mean_after_adding_value","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 14, 18, 20, 22 dan 26. Jika satu nilai 32 ditambah, berapakah min baharu bagi enam nilai itu?","options":["20","21","24","22"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah lima nilai = 100; tambah 32 menjadi 132.","Min baharu = 132 ÷ 6 = 22."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[14,18,20,22,26]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2953","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0001","constructFamily":"straight_angle_remainder_ratio","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan satu sudut pada garis lurus ialah 126°. Sudut yang selebihnya dibahagi kepada dua bahagian dengan nisbah 2:1. Berapakah bahagian sudut yang lebih besar?","options":["36°","18°","27°","54°"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Sudut selebihnya = 180° − 126° = 54°.","3 bahagian = 54°, jadi bahagian lebih besar = 2/3 × 54° = 36°."],"visual":{"kind":"straight_line_angle","known_angle_deg":126}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-43-2954","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"coordinate_endpoint_and_scale","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Pada peta grid, titik P berada di (3,5) dan bergerak 8 unit ke kanan. Jika 1 unit mewakili 0.4 km, pilihan manakah memberikan koordinat akhir dan jarak sebenar yang betul?","options":["(11,5), 2.4 km","(11,5), 3.2 km","(8,5), 3.2 km","(11,13), 3.2 km"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Koordinat akhir = (3 + 8, 5) = (11,5).","Jarak sebenar = 8 × 0.4 km = 3.2 km."],"visual":{"kind":"coordinate_move","start":[3,5],"move_right":8}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3011","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"hcf_equal_packs","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebanyak 84 manik biru dan 126 manik merah hendak dibahagi kepada pek yang sama banyak tanpa baki. Berapakah bilangan pek maksimum yang boleh dibuat?","options":["21 pek","28 pek","42 pek","36 pek"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Cari HCF bagi 84 dan 126.","HCF(84,126) = 42, jadi maksimum 42 pek."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3012","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0003","constructFamily":"fraction_half_of_remainder","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan 3/5 daripada seutas reben telah digunakan. Kemudian separuh daripada baki reben digunakan lagi. Apakah pecahan reben yang masih tinggal?","options":["1/10","2/5","3/10","1/5"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Baki selepas penggunaan pertama = 1 − 3/5 = 2/5.","Separuh daripada 2/5 digunakan, jadi separuh lagi tinggal = 1/5."],"visual":{"kind":"fraction_bar","parts":10,"selected":6}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3014","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"percent_progress_after_fixed_addition","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sasaran penanaman ialah 240 pokok. Pada mulanya 65% telah ditanam, kemudian 18 pokok lagi ditanam. Berapakah peratus sasaran yang telah dicapai?","options":["72.5%","70%","71.5%","75%"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["65% × 240 = 156 pokok; selepas tambah 18 menjadi 174 pokok.","174 ÷ 240 × 100% = 72.5%."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3015","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0005","constructFamily":"ratio_after_group_growth","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Nisbah murid lelaki kepada perempuan ialah 7:5 dan jumlah murid 144 orang. Kemudian 12 murid perempuan menyertai kumpulan itu. Apakah nisbah baharu lelaki kepada perempuan?","options":["5:6","7:6","7:5","8:7"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["12 bahagian = 144, jadi lelaki = 84 dan perempuan = 60.","Selepas 12 perempuan menyertai: 84:72 = 7:6."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3016","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0006","constructFamily":"median_plus_range_after_correction","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 7, 9, 12, 14 dan 18. Nilai 18 kemudian dibetulkan kepada 8. Berapakah jumlah median dan julat data selepas pembetulan?","options":["14","15","16","18"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Data baharu tersusun: 7, 8, 9, 12, 14; median = 9.","Julat = 14 − 7 = 7; jumlah = 9 + 7 = 16."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[7,9,12,14,18]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3017","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0007","constructFamily":"perimeter_with_side_notch","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Sebuah taman berbentuk segi empat tepat 14 m × 10 m mempunyai satu lekuk berbentuk segi empat tepat sedalam 3 m pada bahagian tengah salah satu sisi. Berapakah perimeter baharu taman itu?","options":["48 m","51 m","60 m","54 m"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter asal = 2(14 + 10) = 48 m.","Lekuk menambah dua sisi sedalam 3 m, jadi perimeter baharu = 48 + 6 = 54 m."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3018","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"area_after_rectangular_cutout","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah papan berukuran 20 cm × 14 cm. Sebahagian berukuran 12 cm × 6 cm dipotong keluar. Berapakah luas papan yang tinggal?","options":["208 cm²","188 cm²","200 cm²","216 cm²"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Luas asal = 20 × 14 = 280 cm².","Luas dipotong = 12 × 6 = 72 cm²; baki = 280 − 72 = 208 cm²."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3019","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"multiple_cuboids_total_litres","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan sebuah bekas kuboid 25 cm × 16 cm × 10 cm. Lima bekas yang sama diisi penuh. Berapakah jumlah isi padu semuanya dalam liter?","options":["16 L","20 L","18 L","24 L"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Isi padu satu bekas = 25 × 16 × 10 = 4000 cm³ = 4 L.","Lima bekas = 5 × 4 L = 20 L."],"visual":{"kind":"cuboid","length_cm":25,"width_cm":16,"height_cm":10}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3020","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"flight_arrival_forward_timezone","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Bandar B berada 5 jam lebih awal daripada Bandar A. Sebuah penerbangan berlepas dari Bandar A pada 9:40 malam dan mengambil masa 3 jam 20 minit. Apakah waktu tempatan di Bandar B ketika tiba?","options":["1:00 pagi, hari berikutnya","4:00 pagi, hari berikutnya","6:00 pagi, hari berikutnya","7:00 pagi, hari berikutnya"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Waktu tiba mengikut Bandar A = 9:40 malam + 3 jam 20 minit = 1:00 pagi hari berikutnya.","Bandar B 5 jam lebih awal, jadi waktu tempatan = 6:00 pagi hari berikutnya."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3021","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"best_value_three_packages","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Tiga pek air mineral dijual seperti berikut: Pek A 6 botol RM21, Pek B 8 botol RM26.40 dan Pek C 10 botol RM34. Pek manakah paling murah bagi setiap botol?","options":["Pek A, RM3.50 sebotol","Pek C, RM3.40 sebotol","Pek B, RM3.40 sebotol","Pek B, RM3.30 sebotol"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Harga sebotol: A = 21 ÷ 6 = RM3.50; B = 26.40 ÷ 8 = RM3.30; C = 34 ÷ 10 = RM3.40.","Nilai paling rendah ialah Pek B pada RM3.30 sebotol."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-44-3022","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"target_mean_next_score","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Purata empat ujian pertama Faris ialah 76 markah. Berapakah markah ujian kelima yang diperlukan supaya purata lima ujian menjadi 80?","options":["96","84","88","92"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah empat ujian = 76 × 4 = 304.","Jumlah sasaran = 80 × 5 = 400; markah kelima = 400 − 304 = 96."]}
